Package: scAutoLoad
Title: Automatically Detect and Load Single-Cell Expression Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("酩酊", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "83895347+mumdark@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Scans directories for common single-cell expression data formats,
    reads count matrices, detects matrix orientation, and creates Seurat objects
    using the assay structure supported by the installed SeuratObject version.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/mumdark/scAutoLoad
BugReports: https://github.com/mumdark/scAutoLoad/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    utils
Suggests:
    data.table,
    Seurat,
    SeuratObject

